1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
 What I am telling is mere theory. Only theory.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,000
 Correct.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:17,000
 And in your case you asked this question. You know he is Ajay. Mr. Ajay.

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,000
 Swami.

5
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:23,000
 You know. He has given crores of rupees to me.

6
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,000
 Swami.

7
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,000
 Even though he earned, he did not touch a single paisa from it.

8
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:43,000
 And one day for some ritual, for his mother's ritual, he has taken 40,000 from that amount as loan.

9
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:53,000
 Then after some time he applied in the department loan etc. he got it and he came with the money to give it to me.

10
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:58,000
 I told it is all your money only. Why are you giving this?

11
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:03,000
 No no Swami. That is yours money. From your money I have taken.

12
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:12,000
 Can there be a practical devotee like him?

13
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:17,000
 Crores of rupees he has given to me. Crores.

14
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:26,000
 Swami. That is all your money only. Whenever I require, you have given me immediately without any discussion.

15
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:28,000
 It is your money only.

16
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:31,000
 Really Swami. That is your money only.

17
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:43,000
 And moreover he is a common man. He is having one son and one daughter. His own family. His old father and mother were in Machilipattam.

18
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:51,000
 He sends some 2000 for medicines to them. His salary is 12,000 in those days.

19
00:01:52,000 --> 00:02:02,000
 And out of 12,000, 6000 goes to some loans. And out of 6000, 2000 he sends to his parents.

20
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:06,000
 And 4000, with 4000 he is leading his family.

21
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:13,000
 In that stage, can a person give crores to me?
